0..46 Comment "//! Natural-number lists test recursive sugar."
47..50 Comment "//!"
51..98 Comment "//! The folds calculate length, append and map."
99..151 Comment "//! They can return a call result or elide `return`."
152..202 Comment "//! They can also nest a call under a constructor."
203..206 Comment "//!"
207..253 Comment "//! Each spelling evaluates to the same value."
254..300 Comment "//! The polymorphic length checks at naturals."
301..346 Comment "//! Each structural call uses a smaller list."
347..350 Comment "//!"
351..407 Comment "//! - cites: [Abel-2004-termination_checking_with_types]"
